{"id":"james","links":[{"id":"q7","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"james","c":3,"v":9},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":1,"v":26},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"James says men “have been made in God’s likeness”; in Genesis, God speaks of making man “after Our likeness.”"},{"id":"q22","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"james","c":3,"v":9},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":5,"v":2},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"James says men “have been made in God’s likeness”; Genesis says God created them male and female, blessed them, and called them “man.”"},{"id":"q24","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"james","c":3,"v":9},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":9,"v":6},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"James says men “have been made in God’s likeness”; Genesis says “in His own image God has made mankind.”"},{"id":"q36","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"james","c":2,"v":23},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":15,"v":6},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com","kalvesmaki.com"],"reason":"James repeats “it was credited to him as righteousness” from Genesis and adds that Abraham “was called a friend of God.”"},{"id":"q54","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"james","c":2,"v":21},"b":{"book":"genesis","c":22,"v":9},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"James says Abraham “offered his son Isaac on the altar”; Genesis tells how Abraham built the altar and placed his son Isaac on it."},{"id":"q114","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"james","c":2,"v":11},"b":{"book":"exodus","c":20,"v":13},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"James says He who said “Do not commit adultery” also said “Do not murder”; Exodus says “You shall not murder.”"},{"id":"q120","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"james","c":2,"v":11},"b":{"book":"exodus","c":20,"v":14},"ups