”."},{"id":"q473","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"james","c":5,"v":4},"b":{"book":"isaiah","c":5,"v":9},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"James says the harvesters’ cries reached “the Lord of Hosts”; Isaiah says “the LORD of Hosts” declared that houses will become desolate."},{"id":"q534","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"james","c":1,"v":10},"b":{"book":"isaiah","c":40,"v":6},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"James says the rich “will pass away like a flower of the field”; Isaiah says the glory of all flesh is “like the flowers”."},{"id":"q536","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"james","c":1,"v":11},"b":{"book":"isaiah","c":40,"v":7},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"James says the sun “withers the plant” and “its flower falls”; Isaiah says “The grass withers and the flowers fall”."},{"id":"q543","type":"quotation","source":"Bible Quotation Database","a":{"book":"james","c":2,"v":23},"b":{"book":"isaiah","c":41,"v":8},"upstream":["bible-researcher.com"],"reason":"James says Abraham “was called a friend of God”; Isaiah says “descendant of Abraham My friend”."},{"id":"h1175","type":"echo","source":"Berean Standard Bible","a":{"book":"job","c":1,"v":1,"heading":"Job’s Character and Wealth"},"b":{"book":"james","c":5,"v":7,"v2":12,"heading":"Patience in Suffering"}},{"id":"h1206","type":"echo","source":"Berean Standard Bible","a":{"book":"psalms","c":64,"v":1,"heading":"The Hurtful Tongue"},"b":{"book":"james","c":3,"v":1,"v2":12,"heading":"Taming the Tongue"}},{"id":"h1233","type":"echo","source":"Berean Standard Bible","a":{"book":"proverbs","c":23,"v":1,"heading":"True Riches"},"b":{"book":"james","c":5,"v":1,"v2":6,"heading":"A Warning to the Rich"}},{"id":"h1234","type":"echo","source":"Berean Standard Bible","a":{"book":"proverbs","c":27,"v":1,"heading":"Do Not Boast about Tomorrow"},"b":{"book":"james","c":4,"v":13,"v2":17,"h